name: Sprott O
family: Flows
desc: One of J. C. Sprott's 19 simplest chaotic flows (case O) — five terms, one or two nonlinearities.
ref: J. C. Sprott, "Some simple chaotic flows", Phys. Rev. E 50 (1994)
tags: flow, sprott, 3d
dt: 0.02
ic: -0.19 0.24 -0.12
camera: 25 20 0 1

param a = 1.0 [0.5, 2]
param b = 2.7 [1.5, 4]

dx = y
dy = x - z
dz = a*x + x*z + b*y
